{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ugh\u2026 this world is cruel. I\u2019m still confused what\u2019s right, what\u2019s wrong? Does good and evil even exist, or are they just values humans made up? A society full of conflict, injustice, and power that only belongs to the loudest voices\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, try stepping into the role of a fragile little orphan, with a strange cat at your side, and face those fragile questions yourself. I wonder how would <i>you</i> decide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters\u2026 well, not that much, to be honest. We don\u2019t have that much funding yet. Haha. \ud83d\ude05</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975130?t=1756963547","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975130/c3b969daf1f186f0a8858910af9e1e274bc67847/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756963547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975130/4eba0f74b8a1c90bb2a399c633f4b888f56fd928/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756963547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975130/4eba0f74b8a1c90bb2a399c633f4b888f56fd928/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756963547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains stylized depictions of violence, including burning at the stake, blood, and death. It also features dark themes such as persecution, moral conflict, and hostility between locals and immigrants. No sexual content or drug use is present."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ugh\u2026 this world is cruel. I\u2019m still confused what\u2019s right, what\u2019s wrong? Does good and evil even exist, or are they just values humans made up? A society full of conflict, injustice, and power that only belongs to the loudest voices\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\